WEBVTT

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:06.910
<b>Bonds</b>

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.780
Wonderful!

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.780
You've gotten so much better.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.870
Yes, please come in.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.750
Kaoru-sensei, how's the lesson going?

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.270
We're just finishing up.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:50.740
Then, would you like to have some tea in the living room downstairs?

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:52.570
Huh? But...

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:58.550
I'll take you up on your offer then.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:15.480
It's good. It definitely tastes better when you have your adorable daughter pouring a glass for you.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:19.280
I feel kind of bad spoiling the family gathering.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:21.290
What are you saying?

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:24.540
We've known each other since high school.

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:29.160
And you live nearby too. Aren't we already like family?

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:34.830
If that's the case, then would you please tell Nanae-san to stop calling me Kaoru-sensei?

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:39.540
But, you're my daughter's violin teacher, Sakuraba-kun.

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.780
I have to make a proper distinction.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:43.520
There you have it.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:57.550
Kaoru-sensei, you've gotten thinner again.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.020
Are you not feeling well?

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:02.530
It's fluctuating, I guess.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.410
I see.

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:06.700
By the way, Nanaka-chan...

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:09.860
...you should find a new teacher for your violin lessons.

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:13.060
No! I'll wait until you're discharged.

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.300
I'm happy to hear that.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.490
But, I don't know how long that will take.

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:21.970
I won't play the violin unless you're the one who gives me lessons.

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:23.070
Nanaka-chan...

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:28.920
So, please get well quickly.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.470
Mum! Be strong.

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:53.620
Dad, Mum has...

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:18.020
So, it's true.

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:25.220
Nanaka isn't my child, is she?

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:29.060
What's done is done.

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:32.400
I never knew either!

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:35.780
But, it was already too late by the time I married you.

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:38.660
Why didn't you tell me when you found out?

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:41.680
You would've asked me to abort if I had told you.

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.010
Obviously!

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:47.810
I would never have an abortion.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:50.320
Because, she's Sakuraba-kun's and mine.

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:53.070
I see.

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:55.670
That's why Nanaka's face looks like Kaoru's.

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:59.470
You made her take up violin lessons so that she could meet him, right?

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:03.900
Yes! I wanted her to properly inherit his talents.

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:07.650
I wanted her real father to reach out his hands to her.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:11.400
Dammit! Belittling me!

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.980
I'm...

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.050
...Kaoru-sensei's child...

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.530
That...

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:30.290
That... can't be true.

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:34.450
Yeah. This is a dream.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.100
A bad dream.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:39.890
Everything will return to normal tomorrow.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:13.680
Dad...

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:46.430
Why? How did this happen?

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:15.920
After that, I jumped down from the second floor window.

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:19.950
By then, the house was already engulfed in flames.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:22.280
Mum and Dad were...

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:25.570
That's enough, Nanaka.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:28.500
You don't have to remember anymore.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.230
How's Nanaka?

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:51.870
She's fine.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.480
The medicine has taken effect and she's fast asleep.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:56.810
I see.

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:59.640
Hidaka-kun, wasn't it?

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.890
I'm sorry we've caused you so much trouble.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:06.360
No, please don't put it that way.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:11.580
Anyway, can you please tell me what happened?

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:12.500
Sure.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:17.130
As I had suspected.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:21.770
As you suspected? Did you know about this?

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:26.390
I mean, that the person who started the fire was Nanaka's father.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.040
No.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:32.230
But, I had that suspicion.

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:39.470
The person my little brother,
 Tsumuhiko, married, Nanae-san...

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:43.770
...and the person who taught Nanaka the violin, Sakuraba...

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.240
...were all close friends from high school.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:53.420
Even after Tsumuhiko married Nanae-san, the three of them still went out together.

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:56.620
During the winter of the year when Nanaka entered middle school...

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.820
...Sakuraba was admitted to hospital because of cancer.

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:03.530
It had already spread throughout his entire body by the time they found out.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.810
His condition was already terminal.

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:12.850
Before he died, he confessed everything to Tsumuhiko.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:17.560
He couldn't die deceiving his best friend.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:21.500
He hoped that Tsumuhiko would forgive them if he confessed everything.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:26.440
But, Tsumuhiko couldn't forgive them.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:32.880
Nanae and Sakuraba both betrayed me!

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:39.150
Now that I think about it, I should have taken his words more seriously back then.

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:40.840
I'll kill her!

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:42.670
Don't say such crazy things!

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:46.010
Besides, Sakuraba is already gone...

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:55.860
If only I had taken care of him better, then perhaps...

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.810
Don't blame yourself.

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:04.570
Nanaka hadn't done anything wrong. 
But she was the one who suffered most.

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:10.430
The police suspected that the fire was caused by arson, and hinted that I was the arsonist.

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:15.460
What I feared would happen had become reality.

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:22.590
Nanaka saved herself but couldn't recall most of what had happened during the night of the fire.

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:25.470
I didn't want to make her remember.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:31.560
No, actually, I prayed that she would forever remain that way.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:38.920
Surely, if she remembered, what she would see in her memories would be too much to bear.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:53.870
So, she's locked herself in her room ever since?

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.980
So, what did Nanaka say?

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:07.970
I'm sorry, but she says that she still doesn't want to see anyone.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:10.650
I see...

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.650
Nanaka, Hidaka-kun is here to see you.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:21.350
Could you at least greet him?

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:24.550
He took the trouble to come here on his day off.

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:26.650
Nanaka, are you listening?

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:27.660
Excuse me...

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:30.360
That's enough, thanks.

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:32.320
But...

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:34.010
I'll come again.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.570
Oh my, Hidaka-kun.

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:44.990
Are you heading out?

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:47.830
Yes, a little dinner shopping.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:51.120
Really? Then, I'll come back again next time.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:52.630
It's okay.

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:56.880
I won't be able to host you, but do come in.

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:59.720
Well... But...

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:21.070
Nanaka.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:25.960
I'd like to talk.

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:33.450
Nanaka?

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:37.170
Nanaka.

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:41.510
Nanaka?!

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:44.120
Nanaka!

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.720
Sheesh, she's just in the bath.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:01.630
Nanaka's aunt sure is late. And Nanaka too.

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:17.090
Umm, Nanaka?

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:21.750
Nanaka, are you all right?

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:24.130
You're not feeling faint from the heat, are you?

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:29.760
Nanaka!

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:38.220
Nanaka! What's wrong, Nanaka?!

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:45.490
Nanaka, I'm opening the door.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.240
Nanaka!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:10.730
Nanaka!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.640
Nanaka, I'm coming in.

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:38.810
I didn't give you permission to come in.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.320
Sorry.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:46.630
Nanaka...

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:48.730
...why did you do it?

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:54.900
No matter what happens, you mustn't think of suicide.

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:58.840
Don't talk like you've done it before!

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:01.080
You don't even know anything!

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:02.400
I do know.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:03.550
What do you know?!

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:09.810
I tried to do the same thing in the past.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.560
During middle school...

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:25.770
...I was bullied by the students from my class.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.970
I ignored them at first.

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:32.130
I just hid my feelings and such.

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:35.380
However, the problem escalated.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:38.580
It went on each and every day.

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:43.790
Finally, I reached my limit.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:48.320
After that...

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:52.570
...I transferred to a private middle school.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:56.570
But I would be absent from school from the slightest problems.

00:15:57.190 --> 00:16:00.250
Then, when I entered high school...

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.570
...I became socially withdrawn.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:06.520
Then, the reason you came back here...

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:12.640
You said that by putting your letters into our secret mail box...

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:16.350
...you had a feeling that you'd be able to reach the me of the past, right?

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:19.590
I probably had that same train of thought.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:24.170
If I came back here...

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.920
...and seeing you all like in the past...

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:32.350
...I thought that I might be able to regain my former self.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:39.440
When I opened my eyes in the hospital...

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:42.360
...I thought, "Why aren't I dead?"

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.710
"If I were, I would be free from this pain."

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:49.960
But, it's different now.

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:54.070
Now, when I remember the time where I thought of suicide...

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.810
...I become really scared.

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:59.880
Because, if I had died back then, then I...

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:04.680
...would not have been able to save you from making the same mistake I had made.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.390
If you had continued that way, then surely...

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.180
When I think of that, I...

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:14.880
I get really scared.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:21.190
Sana...

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:34.680
Ten Years Later

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:46.300
I really should have gotten a blood transfusion from Aoi-onee-sama's mother.

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:50.820
Hinako! What are you doing? It's time to go.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:57.550
Oh, keep it down! A lady takes time to prepare herself.

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:01.570
What lady? You're still a kid. What are you saying?

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:03.770
You're the kid, Youta.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.050
Don't talk big when you're five years younger than me.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:08.750
Forget about that.

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.440
Let's get going.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.130
Hey, slow down.

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:19.530
Sakuranomori Nature Park

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:19.530
Open-Air Concert

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:28.140
Could it be... Asami-chan?

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:32.060
It's really you!

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:34.180
It's been a while!

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:35.460
Aoi-san?

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:37.930
Yep. I knew that I would see you.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:42.500
Because, it's all thanks to you that this nature park still exists.

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.510
I didn't really do anything.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:47.850
If you didn't stand up and fight for this place...

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:51.230
...then this place would be the town hall. 
That's what everyone has been saying.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:52.420
Oh my.

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:53.980
Come, let's go!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:56.130
But, I...

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:08.840
Nanaka?

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:11.220
Sana!

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:17.560
Well, sorry this is coming right before your performance, but there's a little something...

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.410
...that I'd like to give you.

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:21.560
For me?

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:27.860
How did it go?

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:29.600
Did you manage to give it to her?

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:33.490
Well done, you dirty young man.

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:35.730
Here.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.650
A reward for becoming a man.

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:44.830
But, this makes it seem like you're my student again.

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:07.110
Welcome to the Sakuranomori Nature Park Open-Air Concert.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:12.910
My musical performance for tonight is the first tune I ever composed.

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:18.530
This tune took a long time to complete.

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:23.240
In between, there were many fun and happy times.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:26.530
And there were many sad times as well.

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:28.500
I met many people.

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:29.830
Separation.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.430
And then reunited.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:35.910
This tune contains all those feelings.

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:39.150
So, please listen.

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:42.950
The title is Myself; Yourself.

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:39.600
Sana-chan!

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:45.960
I'll definitely finish it before we meet again.

00:21:46.870 --> 00:21:49.940
So, please wait!

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:14.840
Thank you for watching. The end. ^_^
